{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09684","headline":"凉州馆中与诸判官夜集 · 岑参","name":"凉州馆中与诸判官夜集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弯弯月出挂城头，城头月出照梁州。\n凉州七里十万家，胡人半解弹琵琶。\n琵琶一曲肠堪断，风萧萧兮夜漫漫。\n河西幕中多故人，故人别来三五春。\n花门楼前见秋草，岂能贫贱相看老。\n一生大笑能几回，斗酒相逢须醉倒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09684.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09684","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"滕伟明"}